<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεργ-ᾰσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>working out, completion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.45.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>labour at a thing,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πεπονημένη ἐ. [τῆς γῆς</span>] high
				<i>state of cultivation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκριβὴς καὶ πολλὴ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.1.6
				</span></i>
			: <i>treatment, discussion</i> of a subject by an author,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Isoc.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.664
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ καθ᾽ ἕκαστον ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1004e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.121
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητικὴ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Po.</u>
					5.1
				</span></i>
			: pl., ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λογικὴ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm.Math.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
